| External JIT patch stream | Holder request/evidence stream |
| VM safe-point application | Grantor service-point judgment and resource admission fencing |
| VM deopt/fallback | Lapse fact followed by fenced reclamation |
| VM owns execution | Serving composition owns resource authority |

